
## Mage — personal goal: collect magic from around the world

| spell_id | Phrase | What it does | Components | Canon | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `glimmer` | glimmer | Lights up residue of past casts on a surface as a fading shimmer | `item_river_stone` | — | **approved** |
| `echo` | echo | Replays a captured sound out of a resonant surface | `item_captured_sound` + `item_beeswax` | — | **approved** |
| `fetch` | fetch | Tugs a small loose object a short way toward the caster | `item_feather` + `item_wool` | — | **approved** |

## Blacksmith — forges the new Lantern Arch centerpiece

| spell_id | Phrase | What it does | Components | Canon | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `ignite` | ignite | Sets inert dry material alight; clears the dry hedge (Forest Unlock 1) | `item_sticks` | yes | **approved** |
| `temper` | temper | Hardens a hot-worked piece evenly as it cools | `item_river_stone` + `item_spring_water` | — | **approved** |
| `bind` | bind | Closes the seam of a broken hard thing whose halves are fitted together | `item_tree_sap` + `item_wool` | — | ~~rejected~~ |

